 830:../build/CMakeFiles/4.1.0-rc4/CompilerIdCXX/CMakeCXXCompilerId.cpp **** /* Construct the string literal in pieces to prevent the source from
 831:../build/CMakeFiles/4.1.0-rc4/CompilerIdCXX/CMakeCXXCompilerId.cpp ****    getting matched.  Store it in a pointer rather than an array
 832:../build/CMakeFiles/4.1.0-rc4/CompilerIdCXX/CMakeCXXCompilerId.cpp ****    because some compilers will just produce instructions to fill the
 833:../build/CMakeFiles/4.1.0-rc4/CompilerIdCXX/CMakeCXXCompilerId.cpp ****    array rather than assigning a pointer to a static array.  */
